sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Platform Admin
    participant UI as Admin Console (/admin/*)
    participant Guard as FastAPI require_admin Guard
    participant Service as Admin Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16
    participant Audit as Append-Only Audit Trail

    Admin->>UI: Trigger Sensitive Action (e.g. Suspend User, Cancel Session, Adjust Wallet)
    UI->>UI: Prompt Mandatory Reason Dialog
    Admin->>UI: Enter Justification & Confirm
    UI->>Guard: POST /admin/... (Authorization: Bearer <AdminJWT>)
    Guard->>Guard: Verify JWT role == "ADMIN" and is_active == True
    alt Unauthorized Attempt
        Guard-->>UI: 403 Forbidden (Halt execution)
    else Authorized Operator
        Guard->>Service: Execute administrative business logic
        Service->>DB: Begin Atomic Database Transaction
        Service->>DB: Apply mutation (e.g. users.is_active = False)
        Service->>Audit: INSERT INTO admin_audit_logs (admin_id, action, target, reason, ip, metadata)
        DB-->>Service: Transaction Committed
        Service-->>UI: 200 OK (Success message & updated state)
        UI-->>Admin: Display updated table & toast notification
    end
